{"id": "84343a55-9c87-4589-b753-1bb784badc98", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I'll check this in two parts. First, I'll look at the current approval status of your model package versions in us-east-1. Second, I'll look at the audit trail to see who or what set each approval: a person, or an automated pipeline or role. I'm running it in the background because it covers a lot of data.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_uGaDkz1YS4cintLWkoCbwd", "tool_name": "subagent", "input": {"name": "sagemaker-approval-audit", "agent_type": "generic", "preloaded_skills": ["investigating-infrastructure-changes", "discovering-deployments"], "prompt": "{
  "task": "Determine whether model approvals in the SageMaker Model Registry (us-east-1) are actually gated by manual review, or whether model package versions are being auto-approved.",
